# Coverage summary:
#   Controlled vocabularies:  24 enums, 108 named individuals
#   Entity classes:            7 core + 14 methodology/stack/THRIVE
#   Execution taxonomy:        7 classes (partial layer)
#   Datatype properties:      24
#   Object properties:        75
#   SubFramework individuals:  5 (THRIVE, HEARTH, CREST, ROOTS, CHARTER)
#   Disjointness axioms:      11 pairs
#   Cardinality restrictions:  6
#   v3 additions: NeedsDimension, MaxNeefNeed (9), NeedsFramework (5),
#     SatisfierType (5), WorldDomain (3), ArchitecturalLayer (8),
#     LifecycleState (4), cross-cutting datatype properties
# ===================================================================
